The '''Lava Pigman''' is an {{Rarity|E|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be [[Fishing|fished]] up from lava while in the [[Magma Fields]]. It requires {{skill|Fishing|22}} to be fished up, and has {{hp|450,000}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Lava Pigman''' can be fished up from any lava source in the {{Zone|Magma Fields}} with a Lava [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] if the player has {{Skill|Fishing|XXII}}.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Lava Pigman''' is {{Green|36}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|50.00%|1|2|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!<span title="Stacks multiplicatively">Weight</span>
|-
|{{Item|Whale Bait}}, {{Item|Light Bait}}, and {{Item|Dark Bait}}
|{{Green|1.25x}}
|}
(Note that this weight modification will have no effect in practice, since it affects both Sea Creatures that can be caught in this pool.)

