== Behavior ==
The '''Lava Pigman''' mainly attacks players by shooting fireballs, dealing massive amounts of damage. It will also hit the players directly if nearby. However, the player has to hit the '''Lava Pigman''' first for it to attack. It is unknown if this is a bug or not. It takes no {{stat|kb}} when hit.

